stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> working: tools/call returns a task handle
  working --> input_required: server needs input mid-run
  input_required --> working: tasks/update (inputResponses)
  working --> completed: result ready
  working --> failed: execution error
  working --> cancelled: tasks/cancel honored
  completed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
